  <content contentuid="h00f98042g6ed2g84b4g4a9bg8ce1bbe667c6" version="11">Tavern Guard</content>
  <content contentuid="he1c8aaadg6d77gbe84gd590g393d9a7c9e86" version="36">Eh? No one 'llowed inside. </content>
  <content contentuid="h142ed3a5gc732g0e50gea6fgccc3a1b08b7c" version="36">Isn't this a tavern? </content>
  <content contentuid="he0749b95g413eg6588gf355ge217dadf9d5f" version="36">&lt;i&gt;Leave&lt;/i&gt;</content>
  <content contentuid="h127bc5cbgd8aagedbdga3fcge8296184d504" version="34">Scram!</content>
  <content contentuid="h5d66c4edg205bga5e3g4d6bg6ea2c4af4a89" version="24"> &lt;i&gt;Check out what he is wearing&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;</content>
  <content contentuid="h9caa784fg85d1g5fdeg31b5g36dc7d0b06f6" version="24">I said scram!</content>
  <content contentuid="hf5aa77d7g4341g4200g49aag3678fc6a8e59" version="24">Bugger off, before I have to bash ya head in.</content>
  <content contentuid="h87a0e222g8753g2501g7ef1g9c3680756ac6" version="24">&lt;i&gt;You can't really tell anything else.&lt;/i&gt;</content>
  <content contentuid="hdd5906e3g610fg8c6fg2d7eg68f4be4dc855" version="22">&lt;i&gt;You notice a note sticking out of the guard's pocket.&lt;/i&gt;</content>
  <content contentuid="h33f6b73ag3d3agc6fag4897g6c4ace056e98" version="22">Uh what note? Ah this one, was meant to give it to da guy inside but forgot to. </content>
  <content contentuid="hed7cdf40gfac1g2320g957eg7d9df472b61e" version="22">What is that note sticking out of your pocket there?</content>
  <content contentuid="h832f6edeg9a6fge54dg7d59gfe59c2e44894" version="22">Mind givin' it to da guy with da top hat inside? He owes me money for da gig last week.</content>
  <content contentuid="he85b101dg75e7g6bc9ge0deg403d582fa9ff" version="22">Sure, I'll go do that.</content>
  <content contentuid="h77d9a279ge908ga2cdg75d6g710228641c9e" version="22">Nah.</content>
  <content contentuid="h312f3770g3269gc530g489fge7583b60d562" version="22">Off ya pop.</content>
  <content contentuid="hadcf3fb4g98a7gf0f3g6a57gc2989f78feba" version="22">Then bugger off, will ya?</content>
  <content contentuid="h3970cd6bg7e02ga2c8gf382g27c90109b308" version="13">Still have da note if ya wanna give it to da guy wit da top hat inside.</content>
  <content contentuid="hc768a586g3666g8678g0fdbg0eb132f24882" version="8">Ya done what I asked?</content>
